    "status": "PLACEHOLDER — structural metadata only, no vendor tickers",
    "why": "The original backend/data/series_catalogue*.json files are absent from the repository: the .gitignore pattern `data/` matches backend/data/, so they were never committed. Every regional heatmap module reads its catalogue at import time, so the app could not boot without them.",
