    "simulation_only": "ticker_bloomberg and ticker_haver are null everywhere. Simulation mode (ANALYTICS_DATA_SOURCE unset or =csv/simulation) never reads tickers. To run ANALYTICS_DATA_SOURCE=bloomberg|haver, fill in real tickers first.",
    "inferred_fields": "frequency (from units), typical_lag_days (keyword heuristic), dfm_sign, dfm_primary and dfm_factor (from the frontend display group) are inferred, not authoritative. Review before relying on them.",
